---
source: crates/leptoskit_cli/tests/snapshots.rs
expression: "normalize(&stdout(&output), &scratch.path)"
---
Check a graph build's exact artifacts and configuration against an independently obtained digest. Optionally stage selected units

Usage: leptoskit verify graph [OPTIONS] --bundle <BUNDLE> --sha256 <SHA256>

Options:
      --app-target <NAME>
          Select a named target from the root leptoskit.toml
      --bundle <BUNDLE>
          Directory produced by `lk build` in a graph project
      --sha256 <SHA256>
          SHA-256 of manifest.json, obtained independently of this directory
      --unit <UNIT>
          Unit to stage, such as frontends.docs; repeat for several units. Omit to select every unit recorded in the receipt
      --out <OUT>
          Existing parent directory for a new private staging child. A failed check publishes no staging child. Omit to check without copying
      --linux-architecture <LINUX_ARCHITECTURE>
          Inspect selected executables without running them. Does not check host libraries [possible values: x86_64, aarch64]
  -h, --help
          Print help
  -V, --version
          Print version
